 SG_ MCU_WindingTemp : 96|16@1- (0.1,0) [-3276.8|3276.7] "degC" FLEXLOGGER,DYNO_HOST
 SG_ MCU_ControllerTemp : 112|16@1- (0.1,0) [-3276.8|3276.7] "degC" FLEXLOGGER,DYNO_HOST

CM_ "eDyno NVH PoC - CAN FD database. PXIe-8510 loopback: Port1 = DYNO_HOST + EDYNO_SIM (LabVIEW simulator VI), Port2 = FLEXLOGGER (logging). Arbitration 500 kbit/s, data phase 2 Mbit/s, BRS on.";
CM_ BU_ DYNO_HOST "Mimics the dyno host/test automation. Sends speed and fault commands (automated workflow only).";
CM_ BU_ EDYNO_SIM "eDyno NVH signal simulator (PXIe-4468 AO). Publishes actual speed and active-fault state in both manual and automated workflows.";
CM_ BU_ MCU "Simulated e-bike motor controller (computed in eDyno CAN Pack Signals.vi from speed and load torque).";
CM_ BU_ FLEXLOGGER "FlexLogger on Port2. Receive-only, logs all signals alongside raw accel and plug-in results.";
CM_ BO_ 256 "Dyno speed command. Maps to simulator Speed Profile cluster (Mode RunUp -> Run-up Enabled = TRUE).";
CM_ BO_ 272 "Dyno feedback from simulator. BlockCounter = AO block index, used to correlate CAN events with the raw accel.";
CM_ BO_ 512 "Fault injection command (automated workflow). Maps 1:1 to simulator Fault Injection cluster.";
CM_ BO_ 528 "Applied fault state. ActiveId is a single step channel for FlexLogger event/trigger correlation. Freq_* mirror the simulator Fault Frequencies output.";
CM_ SG_ 528 FltSts_ActiveId "0 = none, 1 = Imbalance, 2 = Misalignment, 3 = BPFO, 4 = Torque ripple, 5 = PWM, 6 = more than one fault active. (No value table: FlexLogger 2026 Q3 does not decode signals from DBCs with VAL_ tables.)";
CM_ BO_ 768 "Simulated motor-controller status, 10 ms. Steady-state model: Kt 0.05 Nm/A, no-load current 1.5 A, Rph 0.05 ohm, iron+friction 0.004 W/rpm, 36 V battery with 0.05 ohm, Rth winding 0.6 K/W, controller 0.04 K/W of electrical power, 25 degC ambient.";
CM_ BO_ 544 "Simulator Sim Config cluster, 1 s cyclic so every TDMS file carries the settings used to generate the accel.";

